note rgate front-phase negative control: seed/ng/front/kernels/fib40.om with fib 39 in main. omc compiles this
note file as the reference for fib40's front-ir and a64 build; the stdout lines (63245986 against 102334155) must differ.
global out uchar 32
fn fib n ulong to ulong
if lt n 2
ret n
end
a = fib sub n 1
b = fib sub n 2
ret add a b
end
fn putnum v ulong to void
put out 31 10
p = ulong 31
x = v
while gt x 9
p = sub p 1
put out p uchar add rem x 10 48
x = div x 10
end
p = sub p 1
put out p uchar add x 48
w = write 1 out p sub 32 p
end
fn main to int
putnum fib 39
ret 0
end
